From 5d6933c10f9ff4f10d4009136feae6c278777757 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ihormd <103286172+ihormd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:39:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Pilot prep: business multi-tenancy, OCR quota, webhook
 secret, TanStack patch

- supabase/migrations: business baseline (businesses, memberships, business_id, business RLS policies, business storage policies) and ocr_usage table (service-role only)

- inbound webhook now requires INBOUND_WEBHOOK_SECRET in the apikey header (query param dropped); per-business OCR quota check

- scan path: per-user OCR quota (50/day) via ocr-quota.server

- @tanstack/react-start 1.168.60 (CVE-2026-102989 fix), @tanstack/react-router 1.170.41 (required by start 1.168.60)

- errorComponent prop type unknown; inputValidator -> validator

- .env untracked (.env.example documents INBOUND_WEBHOOK_SECRET)

- isolation-test: setup.sql + rls-check.mjs for the two-user RLS check
